msgstr "Synchroniser les listes de lecture musicales"

msgctxt "#30612"
msgid "Download Jellyfin music playlists into Kodi as native playlists under Music → Playlists → Kofin."
msgstr "Télécharge les listes de lecture musicales Jellyfin dans Kodi comme listes de lecture natives, sous Musique → Listes de lecture → Kofin."

msgctxt "#30613"
